<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mema</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Mema was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soninke">Soninke</a> kingdom on the middle <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niger-river">Niger</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/west-africa">West Africa</a>. According to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mali-empire">Mali Empire</a>'s profile, it was one of the forces in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sundiata-keita">Sundiata Keita</a>'s coalition against Sumanguru of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sosso-empire">Sosso</a>. Their victory at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kirina">Kirina</a> led to the founding of the Mali Empire.</p></div>
